<section class="page-title">
    <div class="color-one"></div>
    <div class="color-two"></div>
    <div class="color-three"></div>
    <div class="color-four"></div>
    <div class="auto-container">
        <h2>FAQs</h2>
        <ul class="bread-crumb clearfix">
            <li><a href="/"><i class="flaticon-home"></i> Home</a></li>
            <li>FAQs</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
        <svg class="waves" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
            viewBox="0 24 150 28" preserveAspectRatio="none" shape-rendering="auto">
            <defs>
                <path id="gentle-wave" d="M-160 44c30 0 58-18 88-18s 58 18 88 18 58-18 88-18 58 18 88 18 v44h-352z" />
            </defs>
            <g class="parallaxx">
                <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="148" y="0" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.7" />
                <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="100" y="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)" />
                <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="70" y="5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" />
                <use xlink:href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="7" fill="#fff" />
            </g>
        </svg>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-one">
    <div class="outer-container">
        <div class="auto-container">
            <div class="row clearfix">
                <div class="title-column col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
                    <div class="inner-column">
                        <div class="sec-title style-two">
                            <div class="sec-title_title">Parents Ask, We Answer</div>
                            <h2 class="sec-title_heading">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>
                            <div class="sec-title_text">Everything you need to know about registrations, advance
                                booking, program safety, and communication.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-one_options d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap">
                            <div class="faq-one_button">
                                <a href="/contact-us" class="theme-btn btn-style-one">
                                    <span class="btn-wrap">
                                        <span class="text-one">Contact Us <i class="flaticon-next-1"></i></span>
                                        <span class="text-two">Contact Us <i class="flaticon-next-1"></i></span>
                                    </span>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <a class="faq-one_phone" href="tel:+{{settings.brandMobile}}"><i class="flaticon-call"></i>
                                {{settings.brandMobile}}</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-column col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
                    <div class="inner-column">
                        <ul class="accordion-box">
                            <li class="accordion block active-block">
                                <div class="acc-btn active">
                                    <div class="icon-outer"><span class="icon fa-solid fa-angle-down fa-fw"></span>
                                    </div>What is Advance Tour Registration?
                                </div>
                                <div class="acc-content current">
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>Advance registration secures your request in our priority queue. Families who
                                            register in advance are contacted first when final tour slots open.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="accordion block">
                                <div class="acc-btn">
                                    <div class="icon-outer"><span class="icon fa-solid fa-angle-down fa-fw"></span>
                                    </div>Does payment guarantee a seat instantly?
                                </div>
                                <div class="acc-content">
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>Advance payment reserves priority processing. Our team contacts you near the
                                            program schedule to confirm the booking and next details.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="accordion block">
                                <div class="acc-btn">
                                    <div class="icon-outer"><span class="icon fa-solid fa-angle-down fa-fw"></span>
                                    </div>How do you keep programs safe for children?
                                </div>
                                <div class="acc-content">
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>We run structured supervision, trained mentors, clear activity flow, and
                                            active parent communication throughout the program lifecycle.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="accordion block">
                                <div class="acc-btn">
                                    <div class="icon-outer"><span class="icon fa-solid fa-angle-down fa-fw"></span>
                                    </div>Where can I see available programs and updates?
                                </div>
                                <div class="acc-content">
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>You can browse all active programs on the Programs page. Program details and
                                            updates are shared there and through our direct communication channels.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="accordion block">
                                <div class="acc-btn">
                                    <div class="icon-outer"><span class="icon fa-solid fa-angle-down fa-fw"></span>
                                    </div>What if I still have questions?
                                </div>
                                <div class="acc-content">
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>Use our contact page and we will respond with guidance on registration,
                                            booking flow, eligibility, and preparation.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
